  "releaseNotes": "JSON path: a filter finds the item of a list by a field, and the path goes on inside it: $.members[?(@.id=='42')].name. Equality only (== and !=) against a text, number, true, false or null; in every protocol. HTTP: AssertJsonPathAny, the counterpart of AssertJsonPathAll, for conditions on several fields of the same item. Additive: no code changes are needed from 6.8.0. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
